WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
This drawing contains more than two gold coins

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:05,580
Now on the market, one gold coin can be exchanged for thirty or forty bottles of water.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,080
Very high value

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,580
Refrigerator can only keep fresh

5
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,580
It also costs a lot of rare resources to build

6
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,840
Quite similar

7
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,840
See how many additional resources you can give me

8
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,220
He clearly knew that this drawing was a product of Jilin

9
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,220
But he asked for four gold coins with just one mouthful.

10
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,220
It's obviously just to trick people.

11
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:23,380
Can't you see?

12
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:25,380
You want to take advantage of me

13
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:27,380
Of course I can take advantage of you too

14
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,380
The most I can give you is one gold coin

15
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,380
three loaves

16
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,380
three bottles of water

17
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:42,720
Is there a composite tool for sale?

18
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,720
But can I sell it without a sword?

19
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:45,720
If you have a job, you must have a sword

20
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,720
At worst, it takes some time to collect it.

21
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,720
But long-range weapons may not be cheap.
